			<entry>
				
					<id>14026601512</id>
				
					<title>Screen freeze</title>
				
					<content type="text">After upgrading the iOS system recently in April 2026, the HSBC app keeps freezing after I have logged in. Tried reinstalling the app, tried restarting the phone and nothing works. Of course, I have tried the “HSBC chat with us” function and even went to their branches… it is really out of their staffs’ scope with this IT/app issue</content>
				
					<im:contentType term="Application" label="Application"/>
				
					<im:voteSum>0</im:voteSum>
				
					<im:voteCount>0</im:voteCount>
				
					<im:rating>2</im:rating>
				
