                &lt;font size=&quot;2&quot; face=&quot;Helvetica,Arial,Geneva,Swiss,SunSans-Regular&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;After upgrading the iOS system recently in April 2026, the HSBC app keeps freezing after I have logged in. Tried reinstalling the app, tried restarting the phone and nothing works. Of course, I have tried the “HSBC chat with us” function and even went to their branches… it is really out of their staffs’ scope with this IT/app issue&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
            
            
            
